{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415018","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415018","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041501801:1":{"text":"정말 괜찮은 곳이야. 조금 더 조용한 특별석이 있다면 더 좋았을 텐데.","source_cn":"真是个不错的地方，要是有清静些的包厢就更好了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x13F29ED8A2A67F19","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말 괜찮은 곳이야. 조금 더 조용한 특별석이 있다면 더 좋았을 텐데.","female":"정말 괜찮은 곳이야. 조금 더 조용한 특별석이 있다면 더 좋았을 텐데.","variant_male_record_index":"250189","variant_female_record_index":"250190","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041501802:1":{"text":"옆의 사람이 시끄럽게 떠들어 대면 여유로운 티타임이 무의미해지거든.","source_cn":"毕竟如果旁边有吵闹的家伙打扰了兴致，悠闲的下午茶都会变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EFAD424A3402B08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501803:1":{"text":"저도 동의합니다. 교양 없이 떠드는 평민보다 불쾌한 건 없지요.","source_cn":"赞同您的意见，女士。没什么比那些没有品位的吵嚷平民更让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC479A6B35B60993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501804:1":{"text":"하하, 우아한 손님은 언제든지 환영이야.","source_cn":"呵呵，请坐，我的坐席永远欢迎优雅的贵宾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D3D9B9F7A0F539C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501805:1":{"text":"이럴 때는 오히려 사람이 많을수록 좋지.","source_cn":"这个时候，反而人多些更好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5426780466B21EA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501806:1":{"text":"...가시덤불에 찔린 울음소리가 여기저기서 들려올수록 가장 아름다운 곡을 만들 수 있으니까.","source_cn":"——被棘刺串起的哀嚎，此起彼伏，高低错落，才能组成最美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45F1C02E0997928B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041501807:0":{"text":"심금을 울리는 산자의 고통은 오래가지 못한다는 점이 아쉬울 뿐이지요.","source_cn":"可惜，生者的苦痛是如此打动人心，却无法持续太久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E9DF2439E1E067","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瑟西娅":{"text":"세시아","source":"瑟西娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"슬레이저","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}